==Trivia==
*Phase Five is the first phase to:
**Have [[I Am Groot/Season Two|second]] [[Loki (TV series)/Season Two|sea]][[What If...?/Season Two|sons]] of [[I Am Groot|tele]][[Loki (TV series)|vision]] [[What If...?|series]] that started in the [[Phase Four|previous phase]].
**Have [[What If...?/Season Two|two]] [[What If...?/Season Three|seasons]] of the same [[What If...?|television series]] release as part of the same phase.
**Have a [[Daredevil: Born Again|new series]] centered on a [[Daredevil|character]] who previously had a [[Daredevil (TV series)|television series]] that was produced by [[Marvel Television]].
**Have [[The Marvels|film]] [[Captain America: Brave New World|sequels]] to [[Ms. Marvel (TV series)|television]] [[The Falcon and The Winter Soldier|series]] that were installments of the previous phase.
**Have [[Echo (TV series)|TV-MA]] [[Daredevil: Born Again|television series]].
**Have an [[Deadpool & Wolverine|R-rated]] film.
**Have no [[Thor]] solo films.
**Since their introduction in [[Phase Four]], to have no [[Marvel Studios' Special Presentations|Special Presentations]]. 
*Every film in Phase Five is a sequel to a film in [[Phase Three]], aside from ''[[Deadpool & Wolverine]]'', which is a sequel to the {{WPS|20th Century Studios|20th Century Fox}} {{WPS|Deadpool (film)|Deadpool}} {{WPS|Deadpool 2|films}}:
**''[[Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania]]'' and ''[[Thunderbolts*]]'' are both sequels to ''[[Ant-Man and the Wasp]]''.
**''[[Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3]]'' is a sequel to ''[[Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2]]''.
**''[[The Marvels]]'' is a sequel to ''[[Captain Marvel]]''.
**''[[Captain America: Brave New World]]'' is a sequel to ''[[Captain America: Civil War]]''.
*The TV Series ''[[Your Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man]]''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [[Your Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man/Season One|first]] season released during the same time period as Phase Five.

